{
  "version": 1,
  "params": {
    "category": {
      "label": "Collection",
      "type": "buttons",
      "options": [
        "Images from the Smithsonian Institution",
        "Images from the Rijksmuseum",
        "Images from the Library of Congress"
      ]
    },
    "count": {
      "label": "Sample photos",
      "type": "number",
      "options": [
        3,
        12,
        1
      ],
      "value": 6
    },
    "month": {
      "label": "CIM data month",
      "type": "month"
    }
  },
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "demo-controls",
      "widgetType": "boardControls",
      "config": {
        "title": "Pick a collection",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400,
        "spec": "category | buttons | Collection | Images from the Smithsonian Institution, Images from the Rijksmuseum, Images from the Library of Congress\ncount | number | Sample photos | 3, 12, 1\nmonth | month | CIM data month"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "demo-gallery",
      "widgetType": "categorySize",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{category}}",
        "wiki": "commons.wikimedia",
        "sampleCount": "{{count}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "demo-cim",
      "widgetType": "cimSnapshot",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{category}}",
        "scope": "deep",
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "demo-note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "### Interactive board (ISSUE-50)\n\n**Board Controls** drives three params: `category` (buttons), `count` (slider \u2192 the gallery's sample size), and `month` (stepper \u2192 the CIM snapshot's data month, Latest = most recent published).\n\nThe widgets' configs literally contain the placeholders \u2014 inspect with \u2699.",
        "allowExternalImages": false,
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    {
      "i": "demo-controls",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "demo-gallery",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 8,
      "h": 5,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "demo-cim",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 5,
      "w": 8,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "demo-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    }
  ]
}